Subject: Updated PTO policy effective 1 February
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Team,

The PTO policy is updated effective 1 February 2026.

- Full-time employees accrue 1.67 days of PTO per month (20 days per year).
- Requests of 3 or more consecutive days must be submitted at least 10 business days in advance via the HR portal.
- Unused PTO may carry over a maximum of 5 days into the next calendar year.
- Sick leave is separate from PTO and still uses the existing 10-day annual allocation.

Managers should not approve informal time-off over chat. Use the HR portal so balances stay accurate.

Questions can go to HR.

Jane Okoye
People Operations
